<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Northern States raised.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Northern States raised.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-07-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Merrill Lynch said Tuesday it had raised its rating for Northern States Power Co to long-term buy from accumulate.</p>
<p>-- Merrill Lynch kept its intermediate-term rating of accumulate for the shares.</p>
<p>-- Northern States shares rose 10/16 to 52-3/16 in early trade.</p>
<p>((-- Wall Street desk (212) 859-1730))</p>
</text>
